/*
 * Shared test fixture — not shipped in any package.
 *
 * Ground truth for the outfitting catalogues (data/ships/modules-*.jsonc, primarily from EDCD
 * FDevIDs outfitting.csv, with supplemental identities documented in data/ships/SOURCES.md).
 * `counts` pins the size of each category catalogue; `slotCounts` pins how many records name each
 * fixed mount in `slot`, and how many name none, across all four catalogues — a record's
 * `category` is the file it was read from, its `slot` is the one mount it fills, its
 * `engineeringGroup` is the engineering-menu family or null, and `familyId` is the
 * display grouping every module carries, core modules included. `exclusionGroupCount` pins
 * how many records carry a one-per-ship `exclusionGroup`. `familyCounts` pins
 * complete coverage, `familyGroupCounts` pins the number of groups, and `families` pins
 * representative shared groupings across ordinary and special variants. `records` pins
 * individual modules across every category, including DLC- and grant-gated modules; `shipArmour`
 * pins that getBulkheadsForShip returns a hull's five bulkhead variants. `class` is the module
 * size (0-8) and `rating` the grade letter (A-I).
 */
